    // ===== דף נחיתה: שירותים, מספרים, למה אנחנו, מי אנחנו, שאלות =====
    "svc.T": "What we do for you",
    "svc.L": "Everything you need to sort out when you move, in one place, in plain language.",
    "svc.1t": "Every office in one list",
    "svc.1d": "Interior Ministry, electricity, water, property tax, gas, bank, health fund and more. For each: when to update, a link to the official site and a ready message to copy.",
    "svc.2t": "Every discount you're entitled to",
    "svc.2d": "We check more than 20 discounts and benefits based on what you ticked, and prepare a request message and a list of documents.",
    "svc.3t": "Electricity, water and property tax on key day",
    "svc.3d": "A reminder to photograph the meters, and a place to add the numbers later, without starting over.",
    "svc.4t": "Movers, boxes and bubble wrap",
    "svc.4d": "We work out how many boxes you need based on the size of your home, with a ready shopping list. Where the service is active, you also get quotes from checked movers.",
    "svc.5t": "Want us to do it for you?",
    "svc.5d": "Choose \"Update for me\" and our team member handles the updates and discount requests, based on the consent you gave.",
    "svc.6t": "In four languages, accessible to all",
    "svc.6d": "עברית, English, Русский, العربية. The site was built to the Israeli accessibility standard.",
    "stat.aria": "Avarnu in numbers",
    "stat.1": "offices you may need to update",
    "stat.2": "discounts and benefits we check",
    "stat.3": "minutes or so to fill in",
    "stat.4": "languages",
    "why.T": "What makes us different",
    "why.1t": "Free, no sign-up",
    "why.1d": "No account and no credit card. Fill in and get your list.",
    "why.2t": "Your details are protected",
    "why.2d": "Your details are stored encrypted. Your ID number is never shared with any mover, supplier or partner.",
    "why.3t": "No starting over",
    "why.3d": "Everything you fill in is saved. Leave, come back and finish whenever it suits you.",
    "why.4t": "Full transparency",
    "why.4d": "We're not a government body. We bring the information together, link to the official sites, and tell you exactly what happens with your details.",
    "about.T": "Who we are",
    "about.p1": "Avarnu was born out of real frustration. When we moved, we filled in the same water company form again and again, because every time we left the site for a few minutes, everything was deleted.",
    "about.p2": "We realized that everyone who moves goes through the same mess: dozens of offices, different forms, and discounts nobody tells you about. So we built one place that brings it all together, saves what you've filled in, and reminds you what's still missing.",
    "about.p3": "We're a small, independent Israeli business, and we believe moving home should be exciting, not exhausting.",
    "about.q": "times we filled in the same water company form. That's where it all started.",
    "faq.T": "Frequently asked questions",
    "faq.1q": "How much does it cost?",
    "faq.1a": "Using the site is free. If you choose to have a team member handle the updates for you and there's a cost, we'll tell you in advance, before you commit.",
    "faq.2q": "Are you a government body?",
    "faq.2a": "No. Avarnu is a private, independent service. We bring the information together and link to the official sites. You do the update there, or our team member does it for you if you asked.",
    "faq.3q": "What do you do with my details?",
    "faq.3a": "We only use them to handle your move. Your details are stored encrypted and deleted automatically shortly after the move. Your ID number is never shared with any mover, supplier or partner.",
    "faq.4q": "I don't have the meter numbers right now. What do I do?",
    "faq.4a": "Fill in what you have. Your list shows exactly what's missing, and you can add it later. If you left your email, we'll remind you, and again on moving day.",
    "faq.5q": "Are the discounts guaranteed?",
    "faq.5a": "No. We tell you what you're probably entitled to based on what you ticked, and what to submit. The final decision is made by the municipality or the body that gives the discount.",
    "faq.6q": "How do you make money?",
    "faq.6a": "From partners related to moving, such as movers and suppliers, and only when you choose to contact them. Sponsored content is always labeled, and it doesn't affect the discounts we find for you.",
    "faq.7q": "Which languages can I use?",
    "faq.7a": "Hebrew, English, Russian and Arabic. The messages sent to the offices themselves stay in Hebrew, because that's how offices in Israel accept them.",
    "cta.T": "Ready? It takes 5 minutes.",
    "cta.d": "Fill in your details once and get a clear list with every discount you're entitled to.",
    "foot.terms": "Terms of use",
    "foot.contact": "Contact us:",
    "foot.wa": "WhatsApp",
    "foot.brand": "Avarnu",
    "tr.t": "Terms of use",
    "tr.1": "Avarnu is a private, independent information service. It is not connected to any government or public body.",
